// Plugin: no-direct-useform
// Severity: warn
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Catches:    Direct `useForm(...)`, `createFormHook(...)`, or
//             `createFormHookContexts(...)` calls (TanStack Form's lower-level API).
//
// Rationale:  The whole app shares ONE `createFormHook` instance, defined in
//             `features/_shared/form/use-app-form.ts`. Every entity editor imports
//             `useAppForm` from `features/_shared` and gets the shadcn-bound
//             `field.Text`/`field.Macro`/... components for free. Calling
//             `useForm(` directly bypasses the bound fields — surfaces fall back
//             to raw `<form.Field>` + manual Input/Label wiring, and the
//             surrounding pattern drifts across the codebase. Calling
//             `createFormHook(` per-feature creates parallel context wirings
//             whose bound fields silently lose state (the contexts are app-wide
//             singletons).
//
// Skips:      Detection of renamed-via-alias call sites (e.g.
//             `import { useForm as f } from '@tanstack/react-form'` then `f(...)`).
//             dep-cruiser's `tanstack-form-only-in-shared` rule is the PRIMARY
//             gate at the import layer; this plugin is belt-and-suspenders for
//             cases where the API gets re-exported through a different module.
//
// Suppress:   // biome-ignore lint/plugin/no-direct-useform: <reason>
//
// Legitimate sites carrying this suppression today:
//   • features/_shared/form/contexts.ts      — defines the shared contexts
//   • features/_shared/form/use-app-form.ts  — defines the shared hook
//   (Pre-toolkit features like prompt-manager/section-edit-surface.tsx,
//   chat/injections-surface.tsx migrate naturally when touched. The exemptions
//   live in `.dependency-cruiser.cjs`'s `tanstack-form-only-in-shared` rule.)
//
// Refs:       docs/architecture/core/UI-Lib-TanStack-Form.md
//             .dependency-cruiser.cjs (primary gate at import layer)
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// GritQL note: each arm is a call-expression match with the `$args` wildcard
// absorbing whatever the call passes. `as $call` is the span anchor.

language js

or {
  `useForm($args)` as $call,
  `createFormHook($args)` as $call,
  `createFormHookContexts($args)` as $call
} where {
  // The toolkit ITSELF (features/_shared/form/) is the one sanctioned caller of
  // createFormHook/createFormHookContexts — it defines useAppForm. Skip it in-rule
  // (biome-2.4 $filename guard) so the rule flags only feature-code drift.
  $filename <: not r".*/features/_shared/form/.*",
  register_diagnostic(span=$call, message="Use `useAppForm` (and `withForm` / `withFieldGroup`) from `features/_shared` instead of TanStack Form's `useForm` / `createFormHook` / `createFormHookContexts` directly. The shared instance pre-binds shadcn Field components; calling these directly bypasses the bound fields and drifts every editor surface apart. See docs/architecture/core/UI-Lib-TanStack-Form.md.", severity="error")
}
